cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hyperblade-20XX: A Modern Port of HyperBlade"
abstract: >-
  A modernised build of HYPERX.EXE v1.0.0.1, from the 1996 game HyperBlade by WizBang! Software
  Productions for Activision, ported from the hyperblade-decomp decompilation to MSVC x64 and
  C++23. It contains no code or data from the original game; you supply your own copy.
authors:
  - given-names: Zach
    family-names: Toogood
  - name: "The hyperblade-decomp and hyperblade-20XX contributors"
license: LGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/zach2good/hyperblade-20XX"
keywords:
  - HyperBlade
  - ADLIB
  - software preservation
  - source port
